Rank: Pipelock > SkillWard > fuzzd > Veil MCP > Vallum > AgentShield.

Defender landscape is separating into:

- inline mediation: Pipelock / Veil;

- runtime agent monitoring: AgentShield;

- predeployment + detonation: SkillWard;

