NON-OBVIOUS EDGE / SEESAW

Agent capability is not merely becoming abundant; decision generation
itself is splitting into slow generative cognition and cheap bounded
control. JEV/Jevlike-like heads can increasingly handle routing,
permission, action choice and policy selection without spending a full
generative turn. If that works, the scarce layer moves again: from
model intelligence toward the correctness of the allowed action set,
authority attached to each action, and evidence required before
execution. That is almost exactly QP=E2=80=99s natural territory.

